{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19148","headline":"洛中逢白监同话游梁之乐因寄宣武令狐相公 · 刘禹锡","name":"洛中逢白监同话游梁之乐因寄宣武令狐相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾经谢病各游梁，今日相逢忆孝王。\n少有一身兼将相，更能四面占文章。\n开颜坐上催飞盏，廻首庭中看舞枪。\n借问风前兼月下，不知何客对胡牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}